@post_election
on-arrival: {!
// set congress proportion to votes
Q.spd_r = Q.spd_votes;
Q.union_r = Q.union_votes;
Q.linke_r = Q.linke_votes;
Q.gruene_r = Q.gruene_votes;
Q.fdp_r = Q.fdp_votes;
Q.bsw_r = Q.bsw_votes;
Q.afd_r = Q.afd_votes;
Q.other_r = Q.other_votes;

// The largest party can only be the NSDAP or the SPD.
Q.largest_party = 'SPD';
if (Q.afd_r >= Q.spd_r && Q.afd_r >= Q.linke_r) {
    Q.largest_party = 'AfD';
}
if (Q.linke_r >= Q.spd_r && Q.linke_r >= Q.afd_r) {
    Q.largest_party = 'Linke';
}

// coalitions
Q.weimar_coalition = Q.spd_r + Q.gruene_r + Q.union_r - 3;
Q.grand_coalition = Q.spd_r + Q.gruene_r + Q.union_r + Q.fdp_r;
Q.bourgeois_coalition = Q.gruene_r + Q.union_r + Q.fdp_r + Q.other_r;
Q.center_right_coalition = Q.union_r + Q.gruene_r + Q.fdp_r + Q.other_r + Q.bsw_r;
Q.right_coalition = Q.union_r + Q.fdp_r + Q.other_r + Q.bsw_r;
Q.far_right_coalition = Q.bsw_r + Q.afd_r;
Q.left_coalition = Q.spd_r + Q.linke_r;
// this is an absurd concept lol
Q.united_front_coalition = Q.spd_r + Q.linke_r + Q.union_r + Q.gruene_r - 3;
Q.anti_democratic_coalition = Q.linke_r + Q.afd_r;
// aka everyone except nazi, kpd, dnvp
Q.neo_weimar_coalition = Q.spd_r + Q.gruene_r + Q.union_r + Q.fdp_r + Q.other_r;
!}

The electoral system is essentially proportional, with the proportion of Reichstag seats roughly equal to the proportion of votes.
 
**Election results:**

# 1928: 30, 1930: 25, 1932: 22
SPD: [+ spd_r +]

# 1928: 15, 1930: 15, 1932: 
Z + BVP: [+ union_r +]

# 1928: 10, 1930: 13
KPD: [+ linke_r +]

# 1928: 5, 1930: 4 (as DstP)
DDP: [+ gruene_r +]

# 1928: 9, 1930: 5
DVP: [+ fdp_r +]

# 1928: 14, 1930: 7
DNVP: [+ bsw_r +]

# 1928: 3, 1930: 18
NSDAP: [+ afd_r +]

# 1928: 9, 1930: 10
Other: [+ other_r +]

**Potential coalitions:**

Weimar Coalition (SPD + Z + DDP): [+ weimar_coalition +]

Grand Coalition (SPD + Z + BVP + DDP + DVP): [+ grand_coalition +]

Bourgeois Coalition (Z + BVP + DDP + DVP + Others): [+ bourgeois_coalition +]

Right-wing Coalition (Z + BVP + DVP + Others + DNVP): [+ right_coalition +]

